# Huatli, Poet of Unity: "When Huatli enters, search your library for a basic land card ..." - a library with no basic land holds nothing
# to find, and the search still ends (CR 701.23b); the hand stays as it was. "{3}{R/W}{R/W}: ... Activate only as a sorcery." On turn 3
# Bot1 has the five mana (one of each colour, from five Moxen) but casts an Ornithopter first: with it on the stack the
# ability is refused (CR 307.5); once it resolves, the two hybrid symbols are paid with Mox Ruby's red and Mox Pearl's white (CR 107.4e; each
# is {R/W}, so no other pairing leaves the generic {3} payable by green, blue and black alone). The Saga comes back with one lore counter and the hand holds only the Grizzly Bears drawn on turn 3 (the front trigger does not fire again).

